{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Do not silently swallow inline MDC restoration failures.** Once an inline executor has settled `result`, this ignores every non-JVM-fatal restoration exception or `Error`, allowing the caller thread to continue with corrupted or leaked MDC. Apply a reliable fallback such as clearing the MDC and verifying restoration, or fail the invocation before publishing its selected outcome.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77NvAw","finding_digest":"51b3110768aa57a025405e5f29773d4785c5995e5de3fc606cd430926b507f01","finding_id":"arf_v1_kgzrcb3ivjl2ajkalzpss5z5i6","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::inline-mdc-restoration-leak","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::inline-mdc-restoration-leak","line":292,"observation_digest":"541ede3fd1222c702026d56fe4178d23b8b833cb0ce923e90cb56c41099be987","observation_id":"aro_v1_kqpn4p6reiwhaibg2vx6if4neo","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_kgzrcb3ivjl2ajkalzpss5z5i6","published_at":"2026-10-08T04:31:00Z","review_id":"arr_v1_gznuwbdoezgdubsa2zuhlunkko","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"880c672b694dd6e9859596872447c03fb779d522","reviewer":"codex","start_line":289,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_b3m6q4nxlahltuvy2tfsh7ig4a","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T04:31:00Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
